  "12838": {
   "skill_id": "gh_BinomialTheorem",
   "label": "例題9 二項式係數和的證明（自評）",
   "mode": "ungraded",
   "practice_scaffold": [
    "寫出 (x+y)^n 的展開式",
    "以 x=1、y=1 代入",
    "整理得證"
   ],
   "reference_solution": [
    "【寫出展開式】由二項式定理，$\\left(x+y\\right)^{n}=C_{0}^{n}x^{n}+C_{1}^{n}x^{n-1}y+C_{2}^{n}x^{n-2}y^{2}+\\cdots +C_{n}^{n}y^{n}$。",
    "【以 $x=1$、$y=1$ 代入】$\\left(1+1\\right)^{n}=C_{0}^{n}+C_{1}^{n}+C_{2}^{n}+\\cdots +C_{n}^{n}$。",
    "【整理得證】左式 $=2^{n}$，所以 $C_{0}^{n}+C_{1}^{n}+C_{2}^{n}+\\cdots +C_{n}^{n}=2^{n}$，故得證。"
   ],
   "problem_text_sha256": "0419e5e4847283b1fee11288c76da1473a4f6c6ef13eceb1928d64fefe549e65",
   "oracle": {
    "verified": "sympy summation=2^n (symbolic ok) + n=1..39 numeric + substitution into expanded (x+y)^n, n=1..12",
    "script": "reports/gh_math2_unit5_fixed/build_proof_entries.py"
   }
  },
