   "reference_solution": [
    "【寫出展開式】由二項式定理，$\\left(x+y\\right)^{n}=C_{0}^{n}x^{n}+C_{1}^{n}x^{n-1}y+C_{2}^{n}x^{n-2}y^{2}+\\cdots +C_{n}^{n}y^{n}$。",
    "【以 $x=1$、$y=-1$ 代入】$\\left(1-1\\right)^{n}=C_{0}^{n}-C_{1}^{n}+C_{2}^{n}-C_{3}^{n}+\\cdots +\\left(-1\\right)^{n}C_{n}^{n}$。",
    "【整理得證】因為 $n$ 為正整數，左式 $=0^{n}=0$，所以 $C_{0}^{n}-C_{1}^{n}+C_{2}^{n}-\\cdots +\\left(-1\\right)^{n}C_{n}^{n}=0$，故得證。"
   ],
